\mathcal U)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\forall B\\;(A\\subseteq B\\subseteq\\mathcal P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\to B\\in\\mathcal U)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathcal P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\;(A\\in\\mathcal U\\lor\\mathcal P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal U)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;(0&lt;|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal U)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\lambda\\;\\{x\\in\\mathcal P_\\kappa(\\lambda):\\alpha\\in x\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\forall f:A\\to\\lambda\\;\\left(\\forall x\\in A\\;(f(x)\\in x)\\to\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\lambda\\;\\{x\\in A:f(x)=\\alpha\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The final two clauses are fineness and normality; a merely <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathcal P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\)</span> is not yet a supercompactness measure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mathcal U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_\\kappa(\\lambda)=\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda:|x|<\\kappa\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}